Scream 4 is a horror, mystery film directed by Wes Craven.

3
00:10:05,454 --> 00:10:11,454
Ten years after the original Woodsboro murders, one of the survivors returns home to promote their new book
about surviving trauma, only for a new Ghostface killer to emerge, targeting a new group of teens.

4
