without the involvement of the main cast or crew of the films, although Roger L.

29
01:37:32,727 --> 01:37:38,727
Jackson, who provided the voice of Ghostface in the films,
returned to voice Ghostface in the third season.

30
01:40:54,545 --> 01:41:00,545
A fifth film, Scream, was released on January 14, 2022, by Paramount Pictures.

31
01:44:16,363 --> 01:44:22,363
The film explores themes of rescue, mask, sheriff, jealousy, dark comedy.

32
